&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.3pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;経済状況・為替の変動&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・原材料、エネルギーコストの高騰&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・新興国通貨の価格下落&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・外貨建て調達資材の急激な価格アップ&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;極大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;・原材料使用量の削減及び売価反映の継続並びにカーボンニュートラル活動によるエネルギーの効率的利用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・新興国現地通貨建て取引の極小化&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・効果的な為替予約の実施&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:5.3pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;感染症・自然災害等&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;感染症拡大による事業停止、操業率低下、資金ショート&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:14.1pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-10.1pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・サプライチェーンの分断&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;→一極集中生産拠点における天災地変等の発生&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;→パンデミックに起因するロックダウン等による部材供給のボトルネック発生&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:22.2pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;→BCP（事業継続計画）実施マニュアル等の不整備&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;大&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・グローバル生産管理体制を通じた最適マネジメントの実行&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・材料調達のセカンドソース開拓&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・複数国・地域・工場での生産による供給ダブルソース化の推進及び事業継続計画（BCP）の策定&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・グローバルでのグループBCPマニュアル類の整備、訓練実施&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:5.3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-9.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・金融機関との協調による効率的な資金調達&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
