&lt;h4 class="smt_head3" style="padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(2) 受注状況&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text3" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:13.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt; 当連結会計年度における受注状況をセグメントごとに示すと、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:369pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:1pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;
